# gear254drive.sbc - W141: Fahr-Beleg mit Geraetewerten (Nutzer 6.11.):
# R=FE N=FF 1.=01 5.=05, je mit Vollgas. Lauf: -startloop (Motor an,
# keine Q/E-Gaenge in der Kette) + sbc_usb=1 + diese Fixture +
# gear_diag=1 + input_diag=1 (Gang-Lampen im SBC-LED-Log).
# Anker: VT online ([0x53831C]==1); Phasen je 3000 Frames:
# R+Gas (rueckwaerts?) -> N+Gas (kein Fahren?) -> 1+Gas (vorwaerts) ->
# 5+Gas (schnell vorwaerts) -> Gas weg, N.
# Neutral: Aiming 0x80, Pedale 0, Tuner 0, Gang 08 (N).
f0 00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08
mem:0x53831C=0x1
f0     00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 FF 00 FE
f3000  00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 FF 00 FF
f6000  00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 FF 00 01
f9000  00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 FF 00 05
f12000 00 1A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 FF
